WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.376
You want to have lunch together?

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:05.547
I'm exhausted.

00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:12.595
Hamburgers are just the thing
when you're tired.

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:15.557
Why did she invite me?

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:19.811
Well, I guess it beats
agonizing over my art.

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:23.273
You eat a lot for someone so thin.

00:00:23.982 --> 00:00:25.233
Really?

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:27.694
You need a lot of stamina to make art.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.321
Girls studying art often eat a lot.

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:33.658
But the boys often have a small appetite.

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:34.743
I wonder why.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.496
I thought you'd be more intimidating.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:39.748
What?

00:00:39.831 --> 00:00:44.252
People good at making art
often look intimidating.

00:00:44.335 --> 00:00:45.754
I get you.

00:00:46.254 --> 00:00:48.465
Those non-first timers are scary.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.341
Right, so scary.

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:51.718
I'm relieved.

00:00:51.801 --> 00:00:53.094
I thought it was just me.

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:57.223
Cutting out the canvas?
I don't understand.

00:00:57.682 --> 00:00:59.642
I know it could be wild,

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:02.270
but oil painting is wackier
than I imagined.

00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:03.938
But

00:01:04.481 --> 00:01:06.649
that's also a way to mix things up.

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:12.739
Again, I almost let my thoughts stop
at a superficial level.

